 + T wave inversion</td><td>\u00b1 ST depression + T wave inversion</td><td>ST elevation or otherwise meeting criteria</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Troponin</strong></td><td>Negative</td><td>Negative</td><td>Positive</td><td>Positive</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}